        "Description": "The Kenyon Royal Family have recently been hiring the unfortunate to eliminate their buisness competitors for them. Catherine Kenyon is supervising a broadcasted attempted execution of Athena Savalas, hiring a fired banker, known robber, unrespected security guard and personal secretary of Athena to commit the hit. Mrs Savalas, acknowledging what is a serious attack that may take her life, needs the best of the best before these maniacs engage. \rI shall leave you to prepare, 47.\r\rShkerrrr-",
